      "manifest": {
        "attribution": "SGLang f80c91a4b97e52e17fbcff088aa6b47b6270f6b9 _hc_combine_norm; b12x a7d7d29b2ef8869086e0ceaa787321f17544e3c9 quant/mxfp8_rows.py and intrinsics.py; Apache-2.0 https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0",
        "contract": "HC4 H5120 small rows; BF16 combine and normalized boundaries, four ordered FP32 FMAs, native minimum amax1e-4 and UE8M0 exponent ceiling; preserves BF16 output and exact FP8/scale bytes. Contiguous8 compiler layout hint;15 component cases including captured first differing real boundary. Full-model equivalence remains to be checked."
      }
