  "attribution": "SGLang and b12x canonical arithmetic; full original attribution is retained in parents. Apache-2.0.",
  "contract": "M6 target residual post and layout8 norm/FP8 quant only. Arithmetic unchanged. Each kernel waits at entry before dependent global reads. Post triggers at return; norm triggers at entry after its wait. All CTAs execute the trigger. Requires programmatic stream serialization launch attribute; no assumption of concurrent residency. Normal CUDA events preserve auxiliary joins.",
